{
    "test_name": "MOB.900_Online_Guard",
    "details": {
        "name": "MOB.900_Online_Guard",
        "type": "browser",
        "status": "paused",
        "message": "`MOB.900` Regression guard: the offline notice must not appear during a normal online run.\n- Asserts `OFFLINE_FEATURE_MESSAGE` (`mobile/constants.ts`) is absent on the home screen.\n- **Strengthened 2026-08-20.** It used to be a lone `assertPageLacks`, which is trap 5's\n  assertion-that-cannot-fail: it passes on a blank page, an error page, or a page that\n  never loaded. It now anchors on the welcome banner and the tiles first, and confirms\n  `navigator.onLine`, so the absence is evidence rather than a tautology.\n- NOTE: Synthetics cannot take the browser offline, so this only ever catches the\n  false-positive direction (offline UI showing while online). The other half needs Appendix C.\n- Wired into `MOB.990_Smoke` 2026-08-20 \u2014 before that it had NEVER RUN.\n- \u2b50 **Also a CRASH GUARD.** `ErrorBoundary` (`mobile/index.tsx:27`) wraps the whole app and\n  replaces the screen with *\"Something went wrong.\"* on a render crash. When that happens every\n  later step fails on a locator that is simply **not there**, which reads as a locator bug \u2014\n  the most expensive kind of red herring. This does not test the boundary (forcing a crash\n  would poison the shared session); it makes a crash **name itself**.\n- The two absences are safe from trap 5 because the POSITIVE ANCHORS above already prove the\n  home screen rendered \u2014 an absence on a blank page would fail there first.",
        "tags": [
            "Mobile",
            "env:dev",
            "Offline",
            "read-only"
        ],
        "locations": [
            "gcp:us-west2"
        ],
        "config": {
            "assertions": [],
            "config_variables": [
                {
                    "id": "fe7958bf-435f-4932-af8e-0931caab79e7",
                    "name": "MOBDEV",
                    "type": "global"
                }
            ],
            "request": {
                "headers": {},
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{ MOBDEV }}"
            },
            "variables": [
                {
                    "id": "fe7958bf-435f-4932-af8e-0931caab79e7",
                    "name": "MOBDEV",
                    "type": "global"
                }
            ],
            "set_cookie": ""
        },
        "options": {
            "device_ids": [
                "chrome.tablet"
            ],
            "disable_cors": false,
            "disable_csp": false,
            "ignore_server_certificate_error": false,
            "min_failure_duration": 0,
            "min_location_failed": 1,
            "monitor_options": {},
            "no_screenshot": false,
            "retry": {
                "count": 1,
                "interval": 300.0
            },
            "rum_settings": {
                "is_enabled": false
            },
            "tick_every": 86400
        },
        "steps": [
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "Navigate to mobile home",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "value": "{{ MOBDEV }}"
                },
                "type": "goToUrl"
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "Let the home screen render",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "value": 3
                },
                "type": "wait"
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "POSITIVE ANCHOR: the home screen actually rendered",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "value": "Welcome,"
                },
                "type": "assertPageContains",
                "timeout": 60
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "POSITIVE ANCHOR: the module tiles rendered",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "element": {
                        "url": "{{ MOBDEV }}",
                        "userLocator": {
                            "failTestOnCannotLocate": true,
                            "values": [
                                {
                                    "type": "xpath",
                                    "value": "(//img[starts-with(@alt, \"icon for \")])[1]"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    }
                },
                "type": "assertElementPresent",
                "timeout": 60
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "Guard: offline message must not be shown",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "value": "This feature requires an internet connection."
                },
                "type": "assertPageLacks"
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "The runner really is online (so the absence above means something)",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "code": "return navigator.onLine === true;"
                },
                "type": "assertFromJavascript",
                "timeout": 30
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "\u2b50 CRASH GUARD: the ErrorBoundary has NOT tripped \u2014 no \"Something went wrong.\"",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "value": "Something went wrong."
                },
                "type": "assertPageLacks",
                "timeout": 30
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "\u2026and its \"Reload page\" button is absent too (the boundary renders both)",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "value": "Reload page"
                },
                "type": "assertPageLacks",
                "timeout": 30
            }
        ]
    }
}